[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4442.87, "timestamp": "01:14:02", "text": "自分の持ち物を変えなきゃいけないんだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4456.63, "timestamp": "01:14:16", "text": "装填し直さなきゃ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4484.07, "timestamp": "01:14:44", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4487.35, "timestamp": "01:14:47", "text": "君は狙いを定めることができない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4488.07, "timestamp": "01:14:48", "text": "再装填中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4490.31, "timestamp": "01:14:50", "text": "何？ 今日の私の目標達成状況はどうなっているのでしょうか"}]